        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Alito, jUSTICE ALITO: So what is the difference between that situation and the non-judicial foreclosure situation where the -- the homeowner is simply notified that the -- the house that -- the mortgage is being foreclosed?"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Gorsuch",
        "citations": [
