          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Daniel L. Geyser, petitioner argues that non\u2011judicial foreclosures are covered by the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act (FDCPA)."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "5cce377b82d7ce533311e22dbb0e548d9fbb8798219df7d38f23744f91fb7549",
